exports[`claude-md export snapshots > category filter and importance limit 1`] = `
{
  "notes": [],
  "text": "## Voice lexicon

The user dictates with speech-to-text. When a transcript contains one of these spellings, they mean the canonical term. Always write the canonical form.

| Canonical | Sounds like / STT writes | Note |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Ashlr.AI | Ashler, "Ashley, our AI" | brand My company (voice tools) (ASH-ler) |
| Zoë Martin | Zoe Martin | person |
| A&B <Tools> | A and B, A "bee" | product |

If a word looks like a garbled proper noun and is not listed, ask rather than guess.
",
}
`;

exports[`claude-md export snapshots > complete vocabulary 1`] = `
{
  "notes": [],
  "text": "## Voice lexicon

The user dictates with speech-to-text. When a transcript contains one of these spellings, they mean the canonical term. Always write the canonical form.

| Canonical | Sounds like / STT writes | Note |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Ashlr.AI | Ashler, "Ashley, our AI" | brand My company (voice tools) (ASH-ler) |
| Zoë Martin | Zoe Martin | person |
| A&B <Tools> | A and B, A "bee" | product |
| NoAliases |  | acronym |
| kubectl | cube control, kube cuddle | identifier |
| =SUM(1,2) | +sum | other |
| Path\\​\\|Kit | path\\|kit, {{path}} | other Keep the pipe \\| and slash \\ |
| Uncategorized | un categorised |  |

If a word looks like a garbled proper noun and is not listed, ask rather than guess.
",
}
`;

